{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39754","headline":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 二 · 黄滔","name":"奉和翁文尧员外文秀光贤昼锦之什 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虽言闽越系生贤，谁是还家宠自天。\n山简媿兼诸郡命，郑玄慙秉六经权。\n鸟行去没孤烟树，渔唱还从碧岛川。\n休说迟回未能去，夜来新梦禁中泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}